{"4209560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "To the Basement. Before", "steam_appid": 4209560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the few flying drones that have not been affected by the virus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is quiet, but crucial: to penetrate the depths of the infected bunker and find what remains hidden in its sections. Something that will later play a key role in the fate of the entire complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With each level, the corridors become more dangerous: unstable mechanisms, security system traps, hidden blocks that are easy to break - all of this is hidden in the darkness. But the drone has a special vision that allows it to see things that are usually invisible, and this is sometimes the only thing that saves you from death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Along the way, you'll encounter epic bosses, such as malfunctioning security machines and distorted structures that have been transformed into unpredictable creatures by the virus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game is a side-scrolling arcade game where flying, maneuvering, destroying obstacles, avoiding traps, and battling bosses all come together in a dark journey through the infected depths.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the few flying drones that have not been affected by the virus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is quiet, but crucial: to penetrate the depths of the infected bunker and find what remains hidden in its sections. Something that will later play a key role in the fate of the entire complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With each level, the corridors become more dangerous: unstable mechanisms, security system traps, hidden blocks that are easy to break - all of this is hidden in the darkness. But the drone has a special vision that allows it to see things that are usually 